1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,640
Multiply one by i.

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:05,403
You get i. Multiply by i again: minus one.

3
00:00:05,403 --> 00:00:07,200
Again: minus i.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,932
Again: back to one.

5
00:00:08,932 --> 00:00:15,872
Plot those four points and something beautiful appears: multiplying by i is simply a quarter turn.

